{"id":"c800033782eba35e","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-critical-value.md","title":"Critical Value","display":"df-critical-value — Critical Value","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-critical-value","aliases":["58-df-critical-value","Critical Value"],"display":"df-critical-value — Critical Value","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-differential.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-critical-value"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-critical-value</span><span>Critical Value</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-critical-value — Critical Value"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c5f44e08576c6b2e\" href=\"?note=c5f44e08576c6b2e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md\">../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e70eff045618bab\" href=\"?note=8e70eff045618bab\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-differential.md\">../batch07/58-df-differential.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,f,M,n\\in V\">\\(c,f,M,n\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CriticalValue}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{CriticalValue}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> 保留原参数顺序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\)</span> 的分量、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(S)=C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\">\\(C(S)=C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(S,p)\">\\(T(S,p)\\)</span> 采用内部指定流形记录的记号；切向量是作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(S)\">\\(C(S)\\)</span> 的实值导子。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>所有存在量化的流形数据均在同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 下求值，不在各个子条件中另行选取光滑结构。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c5f44e08576c6b2e\" href=\"?note=c5f44e08576c6b2e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md\">../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}critical\\text{-}value}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{CriticalValue}_S(c,f,M,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land c\\in\\mathbb R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A,S\\;\\bigl[S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land f\\in C(S)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}\\land\\exists p\\in M\\;\\bigl(f(p)=c\\land\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;v(f)=0\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}critical\\text{-}value}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{CriticalValue}_S(c,f,M,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land c\\in\\mathbb R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A,S\\;\\bigl[S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land f\\in C(S)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}\\land\\exists p\\in M\\;\\bigl(f(p)=c\\land\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;v(f)=0\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Critical value: image of a point at which the tangent differential is the zero map; this is type-correctly distinct from a zero cotangent vector.</li>\n<li>维数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 进入谓词签名，零微分展开为定义域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_pM\">\\(T_pM\\)</span> 上的常零函数图；光滑函数空间沿用上游微分原子的元理论语义。</li>\n<li>Morse theory: behavior near critical points determines topology of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span></li>\n<li>Generic functions: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(M,\\mathbb{R})\">\\(C^\\infty(M,\\mathbb{R})\\)</span> generically has only nondegenerate critical points</li>\n<li>Thom: preimage of regular value is submanifold; regular values are generic</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Milnor, Morse Theory</li>\n<li>Hirsch, Differential Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5f44e08576c6b2e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-differential.md","status":"resolved","id":"8e70eff045618bab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-differential.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5f44e08576c6b2e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}$ 取 [[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"c,f,M,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CriticalValue}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"C(S)=C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"T(S,p)","display":false},{"tex":"C(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}critical\\text{-}value}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{CriticalValue}_S(c,f,M,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land c\\in\\mathbb R\\\\\n&\\land\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A,S\\;\\bigl[S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land f\\in C(S)\\\\\n&\\hspace{22mm}\\land\\exists p\\in M\\;\\bigl(f(p)=c\\land\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;v(f)=0\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"T_pM","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"C^\\infty(M,\\mathbb{R})","display":false}],"bytes":2014,"backlinks":[{"id":"b5c14b388ec6d30c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-382","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-critical-value.md|58-df-critical-value]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["c5f44e08576c6b2e","71fe0dc4c8613e69","8e70eff045618bab"]}